@title EPISODE 08 • THE RIVAL
@bg rival_university_track
Away meet at Eastbrook University. Their track is nicer. Their uniforms are nicer. Their 800 runner is unbelievably calm.
@show alana
Alana: That's Cam Hayes. Don't look.
London: You told me not to look, so now I'm looking.
Alana: He beat me in the indoor mixed relay last year and then said "good race." Like he MEANT it.
London: Disgusting. Sincerity.
After the race, Cam walks straight up to Alana.
Cam: My mom's having a gala. My ex is coming with her new boyfriend. I need a date who can make me look like I'm doing amazing.
Alana: ...Why me?
Cam: Because you're the only person here who scares me.
> [Bold] "She'll do it. For a price." -> c1
> [Good] "Alana, it's your call." -> c2
> [Bitchy] "Pass. Find somebody desperate." -> c3
*c1
@add Alana_Friendship 1
@add Alana_Cam 2
London: She wants your 800 splits. All of them.
Cam: (grinning) Deal.
Alana: I did NOT agree to this.
@jump c_done
*c2
@add Alana_Friendship 2
@add Alana_Cam 1
Alana: (long pause) ...One gala. Fake. Totally fake.
@jump c_done
*c3
@add Alana_Friendship -1
Alana: (quietly) I can answer for myself, London.
She tells Cam yes anyway, mostly to spite you.
@add Alana_Cam 1
*c_done
@show diggy
On the bus home, the only open seat is next to Diggy. Of course it is.
Diggy: You ran a PR.
London: I know.
Diggy: I'm saying I saw it.
> [Sweet] "...Thanks. That actually means something." -> d1
> [Bitchy] "Were you watching me, Williams?" -> d2
> [Bold] Steal one of his earbuds. "What are we listening to?" -> d3
*d1
@add Diggy_Affection 2
@add Diggy_Trust 1
He nods once and looks out the window, and you're pretty sure he's smiling at his own reflection.
@jump d_done
*d2
@add Diggy_Affection 1
Diggy: Whole team was watching. I'm just the only one who said something.
@jump d_done
*d3
@add Diggy_Affection 3
Old Usher. Two hours in the dark with one earbud each. You fall asleep on his shoulder. Cassie takes a picture. Of course she does.
*d_done
